---
title: "Sale Lifecycle State Machine (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_prefund: initialize() called
    q_prefund --> q_alloc_period: prefundEndTime reached
    q_alloc_period --> q_active: startTime reached
    q_active --> q_refund: endTime reached
    q_refund --> q_results: refundEndTime reached
    q_results --> q_supply: publishSaleResults() called
    q_supply --> q_distribution: supplyTokens() called
    q_distribution --> [*]: all tokens claimed

    q_prefund --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_active --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_refund --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_cancelled --> [*]: investors call withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()

    note right of q_prefund
        INV-001: Prefund duration 1 hour to 12 weeks
        INV-002: Active sale duration 1 hour to 12 weeks
        INV-003: Refund period duration 1 hour to 2 weeks
        INV-004: Allocation period duration 1 hour to 2 weeks
    end note

    note right of q_cancelled
        INV-005: Cancellation only before results publication
        INV-006: After cancellation, all invested capital is refundable
    end note
